<title>FRANCE: Turkey bought 28,000 tonnes French wheat.</title>
<headline>Turkey bought 28,000 tonnes French wheat.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Turkey has recently bought 28,000 tonnes of French soft wheat at $154 a tonne, Fob, European grain exporters said on Monday.</p>
<p>Shipments will be in June.</p>
<p>The wheat is to be delivered from the 1996 old crop and must contain at least 12 percent protein, they said.</p>
